<div class="section">
<h2 id="awareness">Crime Awareness</h2>
<p><b>Common Crimes:</b></p>
<ul>
<li>Phone Scams</li>
<li>Identity Theft</li>
<li>ATM Card Fraud</li>
<li>Online Shopping Fraud</li>
<li>Pickpocketing</li>
</ul>
<p>

<small>Awareness is the first step towards crime prevention.</small>
</p>
</div>
<div class="section">
<h2 id="tips">Safety Tips</h2>
<ol>
<li>Never share your OTP or banking details.</li>
<li>Use strong passwords.</li>
<li>Verify unknown callers before sharing information.</li>
<li>Lock your home and vehicle properly.</li>
<li>Report suspicious activities.</li>
</ol>
<p>
<mark><b>Tip of the Week:</b></mark><br>
Never click on unknown links received through SMS or email.
</p>
</div>
